//yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Bow Anemo.png\" data-image-key=\"Bow_Anemo.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5b/Bow_Anemo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20210607085607\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_While_the_Arrow%27s_Hot\" title=\"Strike While the Arrow&#39;s Hot\">Strike While the Arrow's Hot</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Skill</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Savvy_Strategy:_Splitting_the_Spoils\" title=\"Savvy Strategy: Splitting the Spoils\"><img alt=\"Talent Savvy Strategy Splitting the Spoils\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Savvy Strategy Splitting the Spoils.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Savvy_Strategy_Splitting_the_Spoils.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/80/Talent_Savvy_Strategy_Splitting_the_Spoils.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251203174011\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Savvy_Strategy:_Splitting_the_Spoils\" title=\"Savvy Strategy: Splitting the Spoils\">Savvy Strategy: Splitting the Spoils</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Burst</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hidden_Aces:_Seven_Tools_of_the_Hunter\" title=\"Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter\"><img alt=\"Talent Hidden Aces Seven Tools of the Hunter\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-